/** @mainpage

This suite exercises tsf-ldap - binding to and querying an LDAP
directory from the Test Agent it runs on, over OpenLDAP:

- @ref ldap-probe - an anonymous bind, a search of a base (or the root
  DSE), and optionally a simple bind with configured credentials;
- @ref ldap-audit - the directory read as a security posture through
  tsf-cybersec (anonymous bind accepted, a cleartext bind over ldap://
  with no TLS, an anonymous client reading entries), gated on HIGH.

The directory is the test's to supply (env TSF_LDAP_URI); with none
configured the tests skip. It binds and reads only - authorized use.

*/
